OL,3,GNEWSAEnthusiast wants to reinstate 1909
OL,4,Aboundary posts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road sign enthusiast wants to
OL,7,Freinstate cast-iron boundary posts
OL,8,Fwhich used to mark a county border in
OL,9,Fthe 1900s.
OL,11,FTim Beer from near Winsham, Somerset,
OL,12,Frescues and restores roadside heritage
OL,13,Fsigns dating back to the 1700s, and has
OL,14,Ftwo of the original posts that marked
OL,15,Fthe line between Somerset and Dorset
OL,16,Ffrom 1909 until boundary changes in
OL,17,F1963.
OL,19,FHe said he wants to use them to have
OL,20,Fmore posts reproduced and hopes to
OL,21,Freturn them to the places they once
OL,22,Fstood.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
